  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Namibia&#xbf;s Energy Transition &#xbf; EU-GET.transform Country Window Namibia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Overall Objective (OO) of the Action is: To have contributed to increased sustainable energy generation and access in Namibia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Specific Objective (SO) is: Namibia&#xbf;s energy sector governance, planning, regulation, procurement and implementation for a low emission power system transformation and in-vestments (including access to finance) have been enhanced, promoting a more equitable access to electricity.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
